WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Line 4 at four times its speed. Belts carry widgets from the depalletizers in the north-west corner.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Lifts carry pallets along the lane, and people and robots walk on booked floor.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Wrapped pallets leave on the output track in the south-east.
